  "script": "Did Nvidia build a three trillion dollar empire by playing by the book? Think again. The untold truth about how Nvidia actually survived... is that Jensen Huang cheated. Let me explain. In 1995, Nvidia was thirty days from total bankruptcy. Their chip was broken. Jensen walked into Sega's boardroom, confessed they failed, and walked out with five million dollars anyway... by pivoting to ruthless automation. Here's the truth: Nobody is perfect. And neither is your business. You're losing eight thousand dollars every single week because emergency calls ring while you're on a ladder, and die in voicemail. Jensen had an unfair advantage, and now you do too. Meet AVA: our 24/7 Voice AI Receptionist paired with a sub-second mobile website. She answers in zero point eight seconds on the first ring, qualifies the job, and texts booking dispatch straight to your truck. Call (561) 813-8602 to test her live, or comment AVA.",
